    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Lady of Musashino (武蔵野夫人 , Musashino-Fujin ) is a 1951 Japanese film directed by Kenji Mizoguchi. The script for the film was adapted by Mizoguchi from the best-selling serial novel by Shōhei Ōoka.",
      "depth": 0,
