      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Street of Shame (赤線地帯 , \"Akasen chitai\" ) is a 1956 black-and-white Japanese film directed by Kenji Mizoguchi. It is the personal tales of several Japanese women of different backgrounds who work together in a brothel. It was Mizoguchi's last film.",
